      "message": "doc: nonce functions are called on the message being signed\n\nBoth nonce function typedefs described the msg argument as the message\n\"being verified\", but nonce functions are only ever invoked by the\nsigning functions (secp256k1_ecdsa_sign, secp256k1_ecdsa_sign_recoverable\nand secp256k1_schnorrsig_sign_*).",
